      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "A request arrives",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>A new request for you shows as a red count on <strong>Inbox</strong> and on <strong>Drones</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/18fe3059f6be2307.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Find it in the Inbox",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Requests waiting for you are under <strong>For you</strong>. They stay there until someone answers them in <strong>Drones</strong> or they lapse.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/d1bbb5b5c7551af1.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the row. The map flies to the target and <strong>Drones</strong> opens on the request.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1736c03b47d3e135.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Choose how it reaches you",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In the Inbox tap <strong>Alerts</strong>. Under <strong>Requests for me</strong> pick <strong>Buzz</strong>, <strong>Banner</strong> or <strong>List only</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6af296e519087feb.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
